    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "winter_Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Haley and I aren't made for such a big house. It's a hassle to keep it clean.#$e#Ah well. I really shouldn't be complaining.#$e#Your farmhouse seems nice and cozy.$h",
      "translation": "Pro tak velký dům nejsme s Haley stvořené. Udržovat ho čistý je otrava.#$e#Ale co. Vlastně bych si neměla stěžovat.#$e#Tvůj dům na farmě vypadá útulně.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "4df04c2e751043d2b38eedde3d29064547b15bb170fdeee8989de8218f19f754",
      "translationSHA256": "16d8a93cb70ebec5e9d996eacf50c6a777aa0b6ebb217e1404b6545be91f0dbe",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "winter_Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It must be so cold for the poor fish.$s#$e#I wonder if any fish hibernate? Maybe I should ask Demetrius.",
      "translation": "Chudáčkům rybám musí být hrozná zima.$s#$e#Zajímalo by mě, jestli některé ryby upadají do zimního spánku. Možná bych se měla zeptat Demetria.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5f83caeabae70040b0487179d0f1ec81ad584beddb364a7f2221dc45542b7d90",
      "translationSHA256": "aba220fb2ce91561882231f664bfea5172bdd3c95040a9655c793dd54c6d361c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "winter_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "If I wasn't so busy I'd help you dig around in that cave by the lake.#$e#I bet there are some powerful crystals inside there.",
      "translation": "Kdybych neměla tolik práce, pomohla bych ti kopat v té jeskyni u jezera.#$e#Vsadím se, že jsou uvnitř mocné krystaly.",
      "sourceSHA256": "8a707a6b72500c73542833a9e5320bad645dbcda1be5f14ab48d7a876497bef5",
      "translationSHA256": "63d5e7af7eed98b149a59f9cd10a0c0af3590ae53708fcf7569ac1853acb2fa6",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "winter_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Do you know how to cook 'Bean Hotpot'?#$e#I like that dish quite a bit.$h%revealtaste:Emily:207#$e#It's hard to get fresh ingredients in the winter, huh?",
      "translation": "Umíš uvařit ‚Fazolový hrnec‘?#$e#To jídlo mám docela ráda.$h%revealtaste:Emily:207#$e#V zimě je těžké sehnat čerstvé suroviny, že?",
      "sourceSHA256": "0112060fb4dd0c6d2a918db5159ce870c059718d007818c51f181b90f6c56a68",
      "translationSHA256": "2169c222aaf2e37aba553562761132e036ad861209b02d1a52928c0bcc8c1fb6",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Emily",
      "key": "winter_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hi!#$e#...Yes?",
      "translation": "Ahoj!#$e#...Ano?",
      "sourceSHA256": "db33b134683c1678ab21a54bb148b67c10236d390a08820d9e45cfb52b84441c",
      "translationSHA256": "402637d06ddef0ec17407254360c02e7c853f96916d2b948ce5f9d45dd3d6376",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
